    "scenesThatPass": [
      "HANNAH: I'm so over music festivals.\nLILY: They're so fucking corporatized.\nHANNAH: Totally, except for Coachella, which is more than a festival.\nLILY: Yeah, it's more a way of life.",
      "LILY: Get out here!\nJASLYN: Ooh, I want the little one. I want to put her in my pocket.",
      "HANNAH: Maybe I'll send them to my sister. She's in eighth grade at John Adams. Isn't that where you go?\nLILY: You're gonna have to transfer schools.",
      "JASLYN: Those little shits aren't picking up.\nLILY: Should we call Jordy?\nJASLYN: Why were we even holding Jordy's drugs?\nHANNAH: When you have two strikes, you can't hold your own drugs, Jaslyn. And we each get a free pill.",
      "HANNAH: There's a trailer flipped on its side. We're gonna be here forever.\nJASLYN: Close the top. Now. Right now!"
    ]
